{
  "__meta__": {
    "key": "qwen_edit_scene",
    "kind": "image",
    "description": "Qwen-Image-Edit 2511 参考图编辑 —— 以角色定妆图为底图生成镜头关键帧，原生中文 prompt，人物一致性最强。占位符：{{prompt}} {{negative_prompt}} {{width}} {{height}} {{seed}} {{steps}} {{cfg}} {{reference_image}}",
    "defaults": {"steps": 30, "cfg": 2.5},
    "note": "结构按官方 edit graph：TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus(带VAE+图) → FluxKontextMultiReferenceLatentMethod(index_timestep_zero) → ModelSamplingAuraFlow(shift 3.0) + CFGNorm；latent 来自 VAEEncode(缩放后的参考图)，负向 prompt 尾部补空格（空串会 NaN）。模型：qwen_image_edit_2511_w4a8 + qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled + qwen_image_vae"
  },
  "1": {
    "class_type": "UNETLoader",
    "inputs": {
      "unet_name": "qwen_image_edit_2511_w4a8.safetensors",
      "weight_dtype": "default"
    }
  },
  "2": {
    "class_type": "CLIPLoader",
    "inputs": {
      "clip_name": "qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors",
      "type": "qwen_image",
      "device": "default"
    }
  },
  "3": {
    "class_type": "VAELoader",
    "inputs": {
      "vae_name": "qwen_image_vae.safetensors"
    }
  },
  "4": {
    "class_type": "LoadImage",
    "inputs": {
      "image": "{{reference_image}}"
    }
  },
  "5": {
    "class_type": "ImageScale",
    "inputs": {
      "image": ["4", 0],
      "upscale_method": "lanczos",
      "width": "{{width}}",
      "height": "{{height}}",
      "crop": "disabled"
    }
  },
  "6": {
    "class_type": "TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus",
    "inputs": {
      "clip": ["2", 0],
      "prompt": "{{prompt}}",
      "vae": ["3", 0],
      "image1": ["5", 0]
    }
  },
  "7": {
    "class_type": "TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus",
    "inputs": {
      "clip": ["2", 0],
      "prompt": "{{negative_prompt}} ",
      "vae": ["3", 0],
      "image1": ["5", 0]
    }
  },
  "8": {
    "class_type": "FluxKontextMultiReferenceLatentMethod",
    "inputs": {
      "conditioning": ["6", 0],
      "reference_latents_method": "index_timestep_zero"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "class_type": "FluxKontextMultiReferenceLatentMethod",
    "inputs": {
      "conditioning": ["7", 0],
      "reference_latents_method": "index_timestep_zero"
    }
  },
  "10": {
    "class_type": "VAEEncode",
    "inputs": {
      "pixels": ["5", 0],
      "vae": ["3", 0]
    }
  },
  "11": {
    "class_type": "ModelSamplingAuraFlow",
    "inputs": {
      "model": ["1", 0],
      "shift": 3.0
    }
  },
  "12": {
    "class_type": "CFGNorm",
    "inputs": {
      "model": ["11", 0],
      "strength": 1.0
    }
  },
  "13": {
    "class_type": "KSampler",
    "inputs": {
      "model": ["12", 0],
      "positive": ["8", 0],
      "negative": ["9", 0],
      "latent_image": ["10", 0],
      "seed": "{{seed}}",
      "steps": "{{steps}}",
      "cfg": "{{cfg}}",
      "sampler_name": "euler",
      "scheduler": "simple",
      "denoise": 1
    }
  },
  "14": {
    "class_type": "VAEDecode",
    "inputs": {
      "samples": ["13", 0],
      "vae": ["3", 0]
    }
  },
  "15": {
    "class_type": "SaveImage",
    "inputs": {
      "images": ["14", 0],
      "filename_prefix": "scene_edit"
    }
  }
}
